<title>THAILAND: Bechtel wins contract for Thai Plastic.</title>
<headline>Bechtel wins contract for Thai Plastic.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bechtel International Inc said on Wednesday that it won an engineering procurement and construction contract for raising Thai Plastic and Chemical Plc's poly vinyl chloride (PVC) resin production.</p>
<p>Bechtel, a unit of Bechtel Corp of the United States, said Thai Plastic and Chemical's plant in south eastern Rayong province will have its annual output increased to 460,000 tonnes a year in 1998 from 340,000 tonnes now.</p>
<p>It said EVC International N.V. will supply technology for the expanded section of Thai Plastic's plant.</p>
<p>Thai Plastic closed at 85 baht on Wednesday, down three baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
